Under the patronage of Her Highness Sheikha Fatima bint Mubarak, 
@UAEGWU
 and 
@ADPortsGroup
, have launched the international track of the Atlaq Training Programme to strengthen women's leadership and specialised capabilities in digital trade and logistics.

I extend my sincere condolences and sympathy to my brother 
@TamimBinHamad
 and his family on the passing of his father, Sheikh Hamad bin Khalifa Al ⁠Thani. May God grant him mercy, rest his soul in eternal peace, and bring comfort to his family during this difficult time.
